hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"131","[AI-translation] Hamein Qutaibah bin Saeed ne hadith bayan ki, unhonne kaha: Hamein Shuraik ne hadith bayan ki, Ali bin Al-Aqmar se, Abu Juhifa se, kehne lage: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Amma main, toh main takiya lagaye hue nahi khata."
"132","[AI-translation] Hamein Muhammad bin Bashshar ne hadith bayan ki, unhonne kaha: Hamein Abdur Rahman bin Mahdi ne hadith bayan ki, unhonne kaha: Hamein Sufyan ne hadith bayan ki, Ali bin Al-Aqmar se, unhonne kaha: Maine Abu Juhifa ko kehte hue suna: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main takiya lagaye hue nahi khata."
